{title: I Surrender All}
{artist: Unknown}
{key: F}

{comment: Verse 1}
[F]All to Jesus I [C]surrender,
[Bb]All to Him I [C]freely give   [F]
[F]I will ever love [C]and trust Him,
[Bb]In His presence [C]daily live.    [F]

{comment: Chorus}
[F]I surrender all!    [Bb]
[C]I surrender all!    [F]
[F]All to Thee, my [Bb]blessed Savior,
[C]I surrender all.    [F]
